,"issn":["20555008"],"issue":"1","journal":"npj Biofilms and Microbiomes","paperid":"160","publisher":"Nature Publishing Group","status":"p","title":"npj Biofilms and Microbiomes","title_org":"NPJ Biofilms and Microbiomes","volume":"11"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-105012942856"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Region of Southern Denmark","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-3a7de3a7-639b-4aed-87b5-90fd86a03f67"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"An anaerobic in vitro flow model for studying interactions at the gastrointestinal host–microbe interface","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-830966","year":"2025","yearsub":"2025"}
{"abstract":"EU’s program, der siden 2007 har støttet de bedste forskningsprojekter i Europa, er potentielt i fare. Hvis pengene i stedet går til projekter ud fra vurderet markedspotentiale, vil det koste på EU’s konkurrenceevne","author_count":42,"contributors":["Eriksen, Janus Juul","Simonsen, Kristina Bakkær","Koksbang, Sofie Marie","Alatraktchi, Fatima Alzahra’a","Albrechtsen, Nicolai","Laurine Albris, Sofie","Andersen, Lau Møller","Arbøll, Troels Pank","Autzen, Anton","Bjerre, Cecilie","Bjerva, Johannes","Bjørk, Anders","Damgaard, Rune Busk","Ellersgaard, Christoph","Eriksen, Christoffer Basse","Golovchenko, Yevgeniy","Hansen, Niels Christian","Hauptmann, Aviaja","Høyland-Kroghsbo, Nina Molin","Ørnsbjerg Jensen, Kirsten Marie","Kruse Jensen, Louise","Jønsson, Alexandra Brandt Ryborg","Kjærgaard, Morten","Kristoffersen, Emil Laust","Larsen, Matthew","Li, Elizabeth","Linding, Stine","Meaidi, Amani","Munk, Patrick","Munksgaard, Rasmus","Wullum Nielsen, Mathias","Kellberg Nielsen, Trine","Pearson, Sarah","Pultz, Sabina","Rotenberg, Eva","Rønholt, Stine","Skovmøller, Amalie","Stahl, Rune Møller","Sylow, Lykke","Thomsen, Torsten Bøgh","Uusimäki, Elisa","Zetterberg-Nielsen, Simona"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-797503"],"filters":{"added":"2025-04","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Nordic"],"country":["Greenland"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","University of Greenland"],"level":"pop","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-HO","DI-NP","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"GV":["DI-GV-ALL","DI-GV-KUM"],"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"NP":["DI-NP-ALL","DI-NP-CAN"],"OT":["Moesgaard Museum"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-CBS","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-RUC","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-GV-KUM","DI-HO-CAP","DI-NP-CAN","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-CBS","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-RUC","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"danske politiker