{"abstract":"Kronik. Forskningsfriheden er under stigende pres fra politikere, erhvervsmæssige interessenter og vores egne ledelser på universiteterne. Det er afgørende, at vi vender den udvikling med konkrete tiltag for at sikre forskningsfriheden.","author_count":28,"contributors":["Albrechtsen, Nicolai","Andersen, Peter Ebert","Autzen, Anton","Bjørn, Anders","Damgaard, Rune Busk","Burholt, Line","Danbolt, Mathias","Ellersgaard, Christoph","Hansen, Niels Chr.","Kruse Jensen, Louise","Jensen, Kirsten M. Ø.","Jønsson, Knud","Kristensen, Peter Marcus","Kropp, Kristoffer","Levisen, Carsten","Møller, Niels Martin","Kellberg Nielsen, Trine","Laustsen-Kiel, Andreas Hougaard","Nielsen, Mathias W.","Simonsen, Kristina Bakkær","Sylow, Lykke","Vallgårda, Karen A. A.","Zetterberg-Nielsen, Simona"],"cuid":["S04-093.39-031490"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":4,"corpau":["Det Unge Akademi"],"level":"pop","mra":["med","sci","soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-CBS","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-CBS","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"forskningsfriheden i danmark er under pres","src":["cbs","dtu","ku","ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dna","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://politiken.dk/debat/kroniken/art8438531/Forskningsfriheden-i-Danmark-er-under-pres","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S04-093.39-031490","ids":["cbs-5145214a-43d8-4dd8-811a-e771cc482ed1","dtu-3579b045-eb82-4749-b6dd-18f87e5cd2cb","ku-38ae7ca9-20a7-408b-9333-5f057b1a19ed","ruc-0750ad8a-5fd9-4e3c-87f3-76d17d4062ad"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Medical Science","Science/Technology","Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-4-F34F7028F5F9C0D64366A072981A0D1B"],"org":[{"affno"