{"abstract":"This book constitutes the refereed proceedings of the 4th International Conference on Computational Logistics, ICCL 2013, held in Copenhagen, Denmark, in September 2013. The 19 papers presented in this volume were carefully reviewed and selected for inclusion in the book. They are organized in topical sections named: maritime shipping, road transport, vehicle routing problems, aviation applications, and logistics and supply chain management.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Pacino, Dario","Voß, Stefan","Jensen, Rune Møller"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-365358"],"event":{"end":"2013-09-27","place":"Copenhagen, dk","start":"2013-09-25","title":"4th International Conference on Computational Logistics","year":"2013"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Germany"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","University of Hamburg"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"computational logistics 000000000004th international conference iccl 000000002013 copenhagen denmark september 000000000025 000000000027 000000002013 proceedings","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"db","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-642-41019-2","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-365358","ids":["dtu-cb957108-d6c0-465e-8e9e-ea760022a19d"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-916213F92FBA49B6E7FD8E7F72D63019"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-642-41019-2","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical Univ